# uruntime 的 pin（可复现原则：pin 稳定值，手动升级）。
# Built-in uruntime pin (reproducibility: pin a stable value, bump manually).
#
# uruntime（VHSgunzo/uruntime，MIT）是 AppImage 的静态 runtime：导入期解
# AppImage 的第一级途径（app 仓 Imports.kt 的三级兜底 ①）——
# `TARGET_APPIMAGE=<镜像> uruntime --appimage-extract` 把内嵌 squashfs 解到
# 当前工作目录的 squashfs-root。它不是 Debian 包（不能走包表），因此由
# scripts/fetch-uruntime.sh 拉取、校验后装进 rootfs 的 /usr/local/bin/。
#
# uruntime (VHSgunzo/uruntime, MIT) is a static AppImage runtime: the first
# extraction route of the guest-side import (route ① in the app repo's three
# fallbacks). It is not a Debian package, so it cannot ride the package list —
# it is fetched, checksum-verified and installed into the rootfs instead.
#
# 变体选择：**appimage-lite**（mount/extract only）—— 两种载荷格式都支持
# （SquashFS + DwarFS），且只带我们用得上的挂载/解包工具。
# 之前 pin 的 squashfs-only 变体解不了 DwarFS 载荷（anylinux / uruntime 一族的
# 产物，如 PPSSPP-v1.4.2-anylinux-aarch64.AppImage 就是 DwarFS）。
# Variant choice: **appimage-lite** (mount/extract only) — it handles both
# payload formats (SquashFS + DwarFS) and carries only the tools we use. The
# earlier squashfs-only pin could not extract a DwarFS payload (the anylinux /
# uruntime-family builds, e.g. PPSSPP-v1.4.2-anylinux-aarch64.AppImage, are
# DwarFS).
#
# URUNTIME_VERSION  上游 release tag
# URUNTIME_ASSET   该 release 里的确切资产名
# URUNTIME_SHA256  资产的 sha256（每次构建都重验）
URUNTIME_VERSION=v0.8.1
URUNTIME_ASSET=uruntime-appimage-lite-aarch64
URUNTIME_SHA256=8485ae20eb0bfd4eaeac38d7fd7f78e153b391c718cf33ff07879605683be1ea
